                                        "sense_id": "8d0a3396-89e1-37c8-84ea-a395859fcaec",
                                        "entry_id": "f74e8790-38b1-3ef4-b12a-42d76eed403a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person well-versed in parliamentary procedure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8f8713d-607c-39a1-9d27-a6938cab0f7c",
                                        "entry_id": "f74e8790-38b1-3ef4-b12a-42d76eed403a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An officer in most legislative bodies charged with being well-versed in the parliamentary rules of that legislative house, and whose rulings are taken as authoritative, to be appealed only to the whole of the house itself under special rules."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "parliamentarian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6dd217b7-de30-30b6-89aa-44e5dcf7a5e4",
                                        "entry_id": "646b1a98-441c-34d6-9516-d1f173835994",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to a parliament; favouring the establishment of a parliament."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0405fd9-590b-435d-8bf1-4fdfe511707c",
                                                "sense_id": "6dd217b7-de30-30b6-89aa-44e5dcf7a5e4",
                                                "text": "a parliamentarian democracy; the parliamentarian movement"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7a90ca9-046f-4da3-9843-d648d9c0f829",
                                                "sense_id": "6dd217b7-de30-30b6-89aa-44e5dcf7a5e4",
                                                "text": "1946, Office of United States Chief Counsel For Prosecution of Axis Criminality, Nazi Conspiracy and Aggression, Washington, Volume 1, citing Wilhelm Frick,\nOur participation in the parliament does not indicate a support, but rather an undermining of the parliamentarian system."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63dd0bff-b8bd-371c-bc2a-76a09d33ec2d",
                                        "entry_id": "646b1a98-441c-34d6-9516-d1f173835994",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to the Parliamentarians (supporters of the parliament during the English Civil War (1642–1651))."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8cf74dd3-a880-462b-b7b9-823b90469785",
                                                "sense_id": "63dd0bff-b8bd-371c-bc2a-76a09d33ec2d",
                                                "text": "[...] Deputies were sent with Commissions into all the Counties; and the Parliamentarian Rebels by force and their own authority, invade the Militia, which they could not obtain from the King by petitioning."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ebf929b-6019-490f-bce0-2b653ee482be",
                                                "sense_id": "63dd0bff-b8bd-371c-bc2a-76a09d33ec2d",
                                                "text": "But while he continued there, he shew’d himself a Dunce, a Tale-bearer to the Parliamentarian Visitors that then acted in the University, and a factious person."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b5e3287-ee84-4dc3-8382-3baad08567fa",
                                                "sense_id": "63dd0bff-b8bd-371c-bc2a-76a09d33ec2d",
                                                "text": "The Scotch and parliamentarian army had joined, and were beſieging York; when prince Rupert, joined by the marquis of Newcaſtle, determined to raiſe the ſiege."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c0383a1-b676-4686-802e-53eef7c879eb",
                                                "sense_id": "63dd0bff-b8bd-371c-bc2a-76a09d33ec2d",
                                                "text": "There were large regions which were very decidedly royalist, others almost as distinctly parliamentarian [...]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0c5b516f-a0d9-46d8-8210-7b63eb804cc1",
